Explain what the following Veneer Spec (.vnr) code does:

```vnr
// ❌ Will NOT parse as JSON — the escaped quotes make this a plain string containing braces
badExample: "{\"a\": 1}";

// ✅ Correct approach — use a raw string so the JSON body is unescaped
goodExample: R"({"a": 1})";
```

This snippet is an example of Arrays and objects only coerce from **raw strings**, not from unescaped quoted strings in Veneer Spec (.vnr).

