Why does this fail?

```vnr
class Derived extends MissingBase {
    bind extra: "self | attr:data-extra";
}
```

The problem: `MissingBase` is never declared. Declare the missing base class in your workspace files:

```vnr
class MissingBase {
    bind z: "self | text";
}

class Derived extends MissingBase {
    bind extra: "self | attr:data-extra";
}
